# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Root ignore for the betET platform monorepo.
#
# Search tools (ripgrep / Cursor) honour .gitignore. Excluding the generated
# dependency + build directories below keeps repo-wide searches fast and cheap
# instead of crawling hundreds of thousands of generated/binary files.
# These are all machine-generated artifacts and should never be committed.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Node / JS dependencies & build output (backend, admin-panel, user-panel,
# cashier-panel, game-engine)
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/build/
**/.next/
**/out/
**/.turbo/
**/coverage/
**/.nyc_output/
**/.parcel-cache/
**/.vite/
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Flutter / Android (M-info-app)
**/.dart_tool/
**/.gradle/
**/.cxx/
**/*.so
**/android/local.properties

# Logs & scratch
logs/
.logs/
.tmp-shot/
**/*.log

# Env files (never commit secrets)
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
